cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WAQF Framework: The 2D Prophetic Management Cycle (Wijhah – 'Azam – Qiyam – Fahs / NSIM × SAFT)"
message: "If you adopt, teach, or build upon the WAQF Prophetic Management Cycle in research, training, or organizational SOPs, please cite this specification."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abelian
    given-names: Ridlo
    website: "https://ridlo.id"
abstract: >-
  WAQF Framework is an open, value-laden 2D Prophetic Management standard
  uniting the 4-stage WAQF operational cycle—Wijhah (Niyyah & Ru'yah), 'Azam
  (Syura & Tadbir), Qiyam (Itqan & I'anah), and Fahs (Muhasabah & Hisbah)—
  with the 4 Prophetic character traits (SAFT: Shiddiq, Amanah, Fathanah,
  Tabligh), operationalized through 13 Hadith and Sirah protocols, a 1-Page
  Execution Canvas, GitHub governance templates, JSON Schema, and an AI Agent
  Skill.
